text.section:
Limitations on subsections (a) through (e). Subsections (a) through (e) are subject to:

subsection (g) and the other provisions of this part;


§ 8.4-210 with respect to a security interest of a collecting bank;


§ 8.5A-118 with respect to a security interest of an issuer or nominated person; and


§ 8.9A-110 with respect to a security interest arising under Title 8.2 or Title 8.2A.
